     "\r\n<font face=\"georgia\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">registrations are open for the 6th edition of the online course: <strong>Generalised Additive Models in R</strong>, taking place from <strong>7–10 December</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Course website:<a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/gams-in-r/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/gams-in-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492471195000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Xbb5h7qZE0AirwLng3VYP\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/gams-in-r/</a> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Generalised\r\n Additive Models (GAMs) provide a flexible, data-driven approach to \r\nregression modelling, allowing relationships between variables to be \r\nlearned directly from the data using splines. In this course, you will \r\nlearn how GAMs extend classical regression methods and how they can be \r\nused in a wide range of applications.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">The\r\n course combines lectures, discussions, and hands-on practical sessions \r\nin R, and topics include model fitting, interpretation, visualisation, \r\nand extensions such as interactions and hierarchical smooths.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">If you are interested, we encourage you to register early as places are limited.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"><br> Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br>mobile: <a href=\"tel:+49%20176%2045230846\" value=\"+4917645230846\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 17645230846</a><br><br><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492471195000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ipDK39LHaneUDxcYH_xej\">Bluesky</a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492471195000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xLhlsLixKDMNFAJI8orjP\">Linkedin</a></p></font>\r\n\r\n"
